fixture ground_slopes
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Slope handling: Up to 45 degrees, speed unchanged; no sliding on slopes"
room test/slopes
spawn 150 544
frames 90
input
  0..59 R
end
expect
  # Horizontal speed holds at 9 u/f up the 45-degree slope (x 320..352), across the plateau, down
  # the far side and up the 1:2 slope.
  during 5..59 vx=2304 ground=1
  mark on_slope 0..59 slope=1
  at on_slope x=2304+x@(on_slope-1) y<y@(on_slope-1)
  at on_slope+1 x=2304+x@on_slope y=-2304+y@on_slope
  # No sliding: standing still on a slope holds position.
  mark stop 60..89 vx=0
  during stop..89 x=x@stop y=y@stop
end
